{"logId": "6ae7b2e6-a575-4a16-8737-9997d1b9bba0", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 2800, "height": 2000, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "第七章 薪酬", "block_bbox": [1192, 296, 1495, 348], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[1192.0, 296.0], [1495.0, 296.0], [1495.0, 348.0], [1192.0, 348.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一、工资构成", "block_bbox": [267, 421, 509, 463], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[267.0, 421.0], [509.0, 421.0], [509.0, 463.0], [267.0, 463.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "根据每个岗位而定。", "block_bbox": [346, 476, 674, 519], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[346.0, 476.0], [674.0, 476.0], [674.0, 519.0], [346.0, 519.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "二、工资支付", "block_bbox": [270, 532, 505, 574], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[270.0, 532.0], [505.0, 532.0], [505.0, 574.0], [270.0, 574.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 公司以货币形式按月支付员工的劳动报酬。", "block_bbox": [346, 588, 1072, 632], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[346.0, 588.0], [1072.0, 588.0], [1072.0, 632.0], [346.0, 632.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1) 工资发放实行先做后付制度，即当月工资次月发放。", "block_bbox": [380, 644, 1247, 688], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[380.0, 644.0], [1247.0, 644.0], [1247.0, 688.0], [380.0, 688.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2) 公司发薪日为每月5日前，如遇公众假期，发薪日可提前或推后。", "block_bbox": [377, 699, 1443, 744], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[377.0, 699.0], [1443.0, 699.0], [1443.0, 744.0], [377.0, 744.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 公司按规定从员工当月工资收入中扣除个人所得税，并代员工向政府税务部门缴纳。", "block_bbox": [340, 755, 1729, 800], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[340.0, 755.0], [1729.0, 755.0], [1729.0, 800.0], [340.0, 800.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 本公司员工不得向他人泄漏自己月薪所得，违反此规定的员工应受到相应的警告、处分，情节严重者将导致解聘。", "block_bbox": [341, 812, 2199, 857], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[340.9998779296875, 820.9999389648438], [2197.999755859375, 812.0000610351562], [2198.212890625, 855.9990844726562], [341.213134765625, 864.9989624023438]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "第八章 福利", "block_bbox": [1192, 971, 1494, 1023], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[1192.0, 971.0], [1494.0, 971.0], [1494.0, 1023.0], [1192.0, 1023.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "凡属公司员工均可享受以下福利。", "block_bbox": [340, 1091, 882, 1136], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[340.0, 1091.0], [882.0, 1091.0], [882.0, 1136.0], [340.0, 1136.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一、节日福利", "block_bbox": [268, 1149, 506, 1191], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[268.0, 1149.0], [506.0, 1149.0], [506.0, 1191.0], [268.0, 1191.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 春节福利：水果、饮料、酒、瓜子、糖（或另定），费用标准：200元/人。", "block_bbox": [342, 1204, 1569, 1249], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[342.287109375, 1196.0018310546875], [1568.287109375, 1204.0018310546875], [1568.0, 1247.9998779296875], [342.0, 1239.9998779296875]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 中秋节福利：月饼、水果、酒、饮料（或另定），费用标准：200元/人。", "block_bbox": [342, 1260, 1536, 1305], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[342.0, 1260.0], [1536.0, 1260.0], [1536.0, 1305.0], [342.0, 1305.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 其他节日另行安排。", "block_bbox": [345, 1316, 708, 1359], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[345.0, 1316.0], [708.0, 1316.0], [708.0, 1359.0], [345.0, 1359.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "二、劳保福利", "block_bbox": [270, 1371, 506, 1415], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[270.0, 1371.0], [506.0, 1371.0], [506.0, 1415.0], [270.0, 1415.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 夏季降温福利：茶叶、白糖、饮料（或另定），费用标准：90元/人。", "block_bbox": [343, 1428, 1478, 1472], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[343.0, 1428.0], [1478.0, 1428.0], [1478.0, 1472.0], [343.0, 1472.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 公司每月为女员工发放一次女工卫生用品，费用标准：4元/人。", "block_bbox": [341, 1484, 1386, 1528], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[341.0, 1484.0], [1386.0, 1484.0], [1386.0, 1528.0], [341.0, 1528.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 公司免费为员工提供工装。", "block_bbox": [344, 1540, 816, 1583], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[344.0, 1540.0], [816.0, 1540.0], [816.0, 1583.0], [344.0, 1583.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "三、结婚贺金", "block_bbox": [270, 1595, 508, 1639], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[270.0, 1595.0], [508.0, 1595.0], [508.0, 1639.0], [270.0, 1639.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "员工达到法定年龄结婚（初婚），标准如下：", "block_bbox": [340, 1652, 1065, 1695], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[340.0, 1652.0], [1065.0, 1652.0], [1065.0, 1695.0], [340.0, 1695.0]]}, {"block_