 1478, 1472], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[343.0, 1428.0], [1478.0, 1428.0], [1478.0, 1472.0], [343.0, 1472.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8834762573242188, "coordinate": [341, 1484, 1386, 1528], "order": 18, "polygon_points": [[341.0, 1484.0], [1386.0, 1484.0], [1386.0, 1528.0], [341.0, 1528.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.858776330947876, "coordinate": [344, 1540, 816, 1583], "order": 19, "polygon_points": [[344.0, 1540.0], [816.0, 1540.0], [816.0, 1583.0], [344.0, 1583.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8671996593475342, "coordinate": [270, 1595, 508, 1639], "order": 20, "polygon_points": [[270.0, 1595.0], [508.0, 1595.0], [508.0, 1639.0], [270.0, 1639.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8738681077957153, "coordinate": [340, 1652, 1065, 1695], "order": 21, "polygon_points": [[340.0, 1652.0], [1065.0, 1652.0], [1065.0, 1695.0], [340.0, 1695.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.862913191318512, "coordinate": [337, 1708, 1080, 1752], "order": 22, "polygon_points": [[337.0, 1708.0], [1080.0, 1708.0], [1080.0, 1752.0], [337.0, 1752.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7423650622367859, "coordinate": [194, 1821, 242, 1849], "order": 23, "polygon_points": [[194.0, 1821.0], [241.0, 1821.0], [241.0, 1848.0], [194.0, 1848.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 第七章 薪酬\n\n## 一、 工资构成\n\n根据每个岗位而定。\n\n## 二、 工资支付\n\n1. 公司以货币形式按月支付员工的劳动报酬。\n\n1) 工资发放实行先做后付制度，即当月工资次月发放。\n\n2) 公司发薪日为每月5日前，如遇公众假期，发薪日可提前或推后。\n\n2. 公司按规定从员工当月工资收入中扣除个人所得税，并代员工向政府税务部门缴纳。\n\n3. 本公司员工不得向他人泄漏自己月薪所得，违反此规定的员工应受到相应的警告、处分，情节严重者将导致解聘。\n\n## 第八章 福利\n\n凡属公司员工均可享受以下福利。\n\n## 一、 节日福利\n\n1. 春节福利：水果、饮料、酒、瓜子、糖（或另定），费用标准：200元/人。\n\n2. 中秋节福利：月饼、水果、酒、饮料（或另定），费用标准：200元/人。\n\n3. 其他节日另行安排。\n\n## 二、 劳保福利\n\n1. 夏季降温福利：茶叶、白糖、饮料（或另定），费用标准：90元/人。\n\n2. 公司每月为女员工发放一次女工卫生用品，费用标准：4元/人。\n\n3. 公司免费为员工提供工装。\n\n## 三、 结婚贺金\n\n员工达到法定年龄结婚（初婚），标准如下：\n\n1. 在公司连续工龄满一年，可享受500元贺金。", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//6ae7b2e6-a575-4a16-8737-9997d1b9bba0/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A38%3A15Z%2F-1%2F%2F5638ae1f85c8e2eeedd60b831b98aabee157f4bcc51bfb2c0eae59a949bc5003"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//6ae7b2e6-a575-4a16-8737-9997d1b9bba0/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A38%3A15Z%2F-1%2F%2F64c3f9c46ba8ad224f15cdea245ffa39dadcbf137c516161a81cb31f5cae2245"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 2800, "height": 2000}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//6ae7b2e6-a575-4a16-8737-9997d1b9bba0/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A38%3A15Z%2F-1%2F%2F639f4dc84ff1bc24ce2ef6529fcd463c764325a66f44fb046c53ccbc3020c735"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
